Color' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 180.0H294.0M48.9 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='106.7' y1='177.0' x2='106.7' y2='183.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='103.7' y='194.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='164.4' y1='177.0' x2='164.4' y2='183.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='161.4' y='194.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='222.2' y1='177.0' x2='222.2' y2='183.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='219.2' y='194.0' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='45.9' y1='140.0' x2='51.9' y2='140.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='32.9' y='144.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='45.9' y1='100.0' x2='51.9' y2='100.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='32.9' y='104.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='45.9' y1='60.0' x2='51.9' y2='60.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='32.9' y='64.0' font-size='10'>3</text></svg></div>\\[A=\\int_0^a\\left(\\sqrt a\\,x^{1/2}-\\frac{x^2}a\\right)dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{2\\sqrt a}3x^{3/2}-\\frac{x^3}{3a}\\Bigr]_0^a=\\frac{2a^2}3-\\frac{a^2}3=\\frac{a^2}3\\]\\[\\frac{a^2}3=3\\iff a^2=9\\iff a=3\\ (a\\gt0)\\]<div class='res'>\\(a=3\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":""},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"def","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2006-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2006-reserva-3-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Resuelve \\[\\begin{pmatrix}2&0&5\\\\1&1&-2\\\\-1&1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix}-2\\\\2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\0\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\\]","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Llamo \\(M\\) a la matriz de coeficientes. \\(MX+\\begin{pmatrix}-2\\\\2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\0\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\\iff MX=\\begin{pmatrix}7\\\\-2\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\\). Calculo \\(|M|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de lo