cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|M|=\\begin{vmatrix}2&0&5\\\\1&1&-2\\\\-1&1&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(2+0+5\\bigr)-\\bigl(-5-4+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=16\\]<p>Como \\(|M|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(M^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|M|}(\\operatorname{Adj}M)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}M=\\begin{pmatrix}3 & 1 & 2\\\\5 & 7 & -2\\\\-5 & 9 & 2\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow M^{-1}=\\frac1{16}\\begin{pmatrix}3 & 5 & -5\\\\1 & 7 & 9\\\\2 & -2 & 2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{3}{16} & \\frac{5}{16} & - \\frac{5}{16}\\\\\\frac{1}{16} & \\frac{7}{16} & \\frac{9}{16}\\\\\\frac{1}{8} & - \\frac{1}{8} & \\frac{1}{8}\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[X=M^{-1}\\begin{pmatrix}7\\\\-2\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac1{16}\\begin{pmatrix}3 & 5 & -5\\\\1 & 7 & 9\\\\2 & -2 & 2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}7\\\\-2\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac1{16}\\begin{pmatrix}16\\\\-16\\\\16\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(x=1,\\ y=-1,\\ z=1\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"ecmat","apartados":""},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"inv","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2006-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2006-reserva-3-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera el punto \\(P(3,2,0)\\) y la recta \\(r\\) de ecuaciones \\(\\begin{cases}x+y-z-3=0\\\\x+2z+1=0\\end{cases}\\)","apartados":["(1 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano que contiene al punto \\(P\\) y a la recta \\(r\\).","(1,5 p.) Determina las coordenadas del punto \\(Q\\) simétrico de \\(P\\) respecto de la recta \\(r\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\): con \\(z=t\\), \\(x=-1-2t\\) y \\(y=3-x+z=4+3t\\): \\(r\\equiv(-1-2t,\\,4+3t,\\,t)\\), con \\(R(-1,4,0)\\) y \\(\\vec d=(-2,3,1)\\).</p><p>El plano contiene a \\(\\vec d\\) y a \\(\\overrightarrow{RP}=(4,-2,0)\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec d\\times\\overrightarrow{RP}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-2&3&1\\\\4&-2&0\\end{vmatrix}=(2,\\,4,\\,-8)\\parallel(1,2,-4)\\]<p>Plano \\(x+2y-4z+D=0\\) por \\(P\\): \\(3+4+D=0\\iff D=-7\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x+2y-4z-7=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con \\(R\\): \\(-1+8-0-7=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Uso \\(r\\equiv(-1-2t,\\,4+3t,\\,t)\\) del apartado a).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a la recta por el punto.</b> Como el plano \\(\\pi_\\perp\\) y la recta \\(r\\) son perpendiculares, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al vector normal del plano<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si el plano es perpendicular a la recta, el vector director de la recta es paralelo al normal del plano; por eso los coeficientes de \\(x\\), \\(y\\), \\(z\\) son las componentes de \\(\\vec d\\).</i>. Con \\(\\vec d=(-2,\\ 3,\\ 1)\\), el plano es de la forma</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv -2x+3y+z+D=0\\]<p>Como contiene al punto \\(P(3,\\ 2,\\ 0)\\): \\(-2\\cdot3+3\\cdot2+0+D=0\\iff D=0\\).</p>\\[\\pi_\\perp\\equiv -2x+3y+z=0\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(r\\) en \\(\\pi_\\perp\\):</p>\\[-2(-1-2t)+3(4+3t)+(t)=0\\iff 14t+14=0\\iff t=-1\\]\\[M(1,\\ 1,\\ -1)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(P\\) y su simétrico \\(P'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{3+a}2=1,\\qquad\\frac{2+b}2=1,\\qquad\\frac{c}2=-1\\]\\[a=-1,\\qquad b=0,\\qquad c=-2\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":56,\"el\":24,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-1.376,-1.239,0.964],[3.98,2.332,0.964],[3.376,3.239,-2.964],[-1.98,-0.332,-2.964]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[3.376,3.239,-2.964],\"π⊥\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[0.84,1.241,-0.92],[1.085,1.363,-0.797],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.085,1.363,-0.797],[1.245,1.122,-0.878],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[2.197,-0.796,-1.599],[-0.197,2.796,-0.401],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-0.197,2.796,-0.401],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[0.679,1.481,-0.84],[0.091,2.363,-0.546],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[0.51,0.755,-1.245],[-0.078,1.637,-0.951],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",6,10],[\"line\",[3.0,2.0,0.0],[-1.0,0.0,-2.0],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"pt\",[3.0,2.0,0.0],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1.0,1.0,-1.0],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[-1.0,0.0,-2.0],\"P′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m06r3b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m06r3b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m06r3b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m06r3b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='126.2,18.0 36.0,107.4 73.2,246.0 163.4,156.6' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='77.2' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π⊥</text><line x1='109.6' y1='130.9' x2='104.6' y2='130.4' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='104.6' y1='130.4' x2='94.7' y2='131.5' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='26.0' y1='139.9' x2='173.4' y2='124.1' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='179.4' y='124.1' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='119.4' y1='129.9' x2='155.6' y2='126.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m06r3b4d)'/><text x='159.6' y='122.0' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='109.6' y1='133.1' x2='145.8' y2='129.2' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m06r3b4n)'/><text x='151.8' y='139.2' fi